 R←Test_Misc_006(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;parms;handlerMsg
⍝ Exercise `CheckServerParms`: valid parameters pass, and every invalid value is rejected with its own message
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '∘∘∘ ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 #.⎕SHADOW'TEMP' ⋄ 'TEMP'#.⎕NS''
 {}#.TEMP.⎕FX'r←OnRequest y' 'r←y'
 {}#.TEMP.⎕FX'r←Niladic' 'r←1'
 ##.Plodder.⎕SHADOW'G'                              ⍝ A local of `Run` in a running server,
 ##.Plodder.G←⎕NS''                                 ⍝ so it must be established here
 ##.Plodder.G.INI←∆CreateIni'Test_Misc_006'('[LOGGING]' 'Log = 0' 'LogHTTP = 2')

 →T.PassesIf''≡∆CheckServerParmsFails ∆ValidServerParms ⍬

 parms←∆ValidServerParms ⍬
 parms.Context←'#.DoesNotExist'
 →T.PassesIf'Invalid: "Context"'≡∆CheckServerParmsFails parms

 parms←∆ValidServerParms ⍬
 parms.OnRequest←''
 →T.PassesIf'Invalid: "OnRequest" is mandatory'≡∆CheckServerParmsFails parms

 parms←∆ValidServerParms ⍬
 parms.OnHeader←'DoesNotExist'
 →T.PassesIf'Unknown handler: DoesNotExist'≡∆CheckServerParmsFails parms

 handlerMsg←'Invalid handler (must return a result and take a right argument only): '
 parms←∆ValidServerParms ⍬
 parms.OnStart←'Niladic'
 →T.PassesIf(handlerMsg,'Niladic')≡∆CheckServerParmsFails parms

 parms←∆ValidServerParms ⍬
 parms.CongaTimeout←0
 →T.PassesIf'Invalid: value of "HouseKeepingInterval" in INI file'≡∆CheckServerParmsFails parms

 parms←∆ValidServerParms ⍬
 parms.IdleTimeout←0.5
 →T.PassesIf'Invalid: value of "IdleConnectionTimeout" in INI file'≡∆CheckServerParmsFails parms

 parms←∆ValidServerParms ⍬
 parms.Secure←2
 →T.PassesIf'Invalid: value of "Secure" in INI file'≡∆CheckServerParmsFails parms

 parms←∆ValidServerParms ⍬
 parms.Port←70000
 →T.PassesIf'Invalid: value of "Port" in INI file'≡∆CheckServerParmsFails parms
 parms.Port←'x'
 →T.PassesIf'Invalid: value of "Port" in INI file'≡∆CheckServerParmsFails parms
 parms.Port←65535
 →T.PassesIf''≡∆CheckServerParmsFails parms

 parms←∆ValidServerParms ⍬
 parms.MaxNoOfThreads←0                             ⍝ Rumba would reject every connection
 →T.PassesIf'Invalid: value of "MaxNoOfThreads" in INI file'≡∆CheckServerParmsFails parms
 parms.MaxNoOfThreads←2.5
 →T.PassesIf'Invalid: value of "MaxNoOfThreads" in INI file'≡∆CheckServerParmsFails parms

 parms←∆ValidServerParms ⍬
 parms.LogConga←2
 →T.PassesIf'Invalid: value of "LogConga" in INI file'≡∆CheckServerParmsFails parms
 parms.LogConga←1
 →T.PassesIf''≡∆CheckServerParmsFails parms

 parms←∆ValidServerParms ⍬
 parms.LogRumba←'1'
 →T.PassesIf'Invalid: value of "LogRumba" in INI file'≡∆CheckServerParmsFails parms
 parms.LogRumba←1
 →T.PassesIf''≡∆CheckServerParmsFails parms

 ##.Plodder.G.INI←∆CreateIni'Test_Misc_006'('[LOGGING]' 'Log = 0' 'LogHTTP = 3')
 →T.PassesIf'Invalid: value of "LogHTTP" in INI file'≡∆CheckServerParmsFails ∆ValidServerParms ⍬

 ##.Plodder.G.INI←∆CreateIni'Test_Misc_006'('[LOGGING]' 'Log = 2' 'LogHTTP = 0')
 →T.PassesIf'Invalid: value of "Log" in INI file'≡∆CheckServerParmsFails ∆ValidServerParms ⍬

 R←T._OK
⍝Done
